WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.675
Violet laughed. "Good-bye, Rocket Girl!

2
00:00:17.676 --> 00:00:20.033
I'm going to the concert at the park.

3
00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:25.592
It will be my biggest performance yet."

4
00:00:25.593 --> 00:00:28.808
Roxy stood there, holding the steel beam.

5
00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:33.373
She felt as if she was in a dream.

6
00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:38.857
"Rocket Girl!" a woman cried. "Wake up!"

7
00:00:38.858 --> 00:00:42.017
But Roxy couldn't move or think clearly.

8
00:00:42.018 --> 00:00:44.187
Her arms felt weak.

9
00:00:44.188 --> 00:00:48.177
The beam fell from her hands and slammed onto the ground.

10
00:00:48.178 --> 00:00:52.790
Bang! Roxy blinked and woke up.

11
00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:56.165
"W-what's going on?" she asked.

12
00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.769
"You were hypnotized," the woman said.

13
00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:02.208
"There was a violinist, and she—"

14
00:01:02.209 --> 00:01:10.071
"I remember now!" Roxy also remembered what Violet had said about the concert at the park.

15
00:01:10.072 --> 00:01:12.415
She flew into a store.

16
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:17.851
A minute later she shot toward Metro City Park.

17
00:01:17.852 --> 00:01:21.865
Violet stood onstage, running her bow across the violin's strings.

18
00:01:21.866 --> 00:01:24.410
Members of the orchestra sat still.

19
00:01:24.411 --> 00:01:26.938
They were all staring into space.

20
00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:29.621
Audience members walked toward the stage.

21
00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:33.563
They held out their wallets and jewelry.

22
00:01:33.564 --> 00:01:39.641
Violet laughed. "I'm going to be rich, rich, rich!"

23
00:01:39.642 --> 00:01:42.480
Roxy watched from far away.

24
00:01:42.481 --> 00:01:45.641
"I'm glad I bought these earplugs."

25
00:01:45.642 --> 00:01:48.334
She popped them into her ears.

26
00:01:48.335 --> 00:01:54.155
"Your big performance is over, Violet!" Roxy darted toward the stage.

27
00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:57.029
"Rocket Girl!" Violet snapped.

28
00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:01.697
She started to play a new song on her violin.

29
00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:08.418
"Play all you want," Roxy said. "I'm wearing earplugs!"

30
00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:12.912
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

31
00:02:12.928 --> 00:02:14.939
Violet leaped out of the way.

32
00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:18.783
The laser beams hit a French horn, which melted into a puddle.

33
00:02:18.784 --> 00:02:21.352
"Yikes!" Roxy cried.

34
00:02:21.353 --> 00:02:23.299
"How can I stop Violet?

35
00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.804
I can't use my eye laser beams again.

36
00:02:25.805 --> 00:02:28.208
Someone might get hurt."

37
00:02:28.209 --> 00:02:31.213
Roxy remembered what Mara had said:

38
00:02:31.214 --> 00:02:34.707
"Temperature affects musical instruments."

39
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:40.811
Roxy blew her freeze breath at Violet. Whoosh!

40
00:02:40.812 --> 00:02:43.567
"Ugh!" Violet made a face.

41
00:02:43.568 --> 00:02:49.004
"My violin is going out of tune!"

42
00:02:49.005 --> 00:02:52.498
Roxy zoomed over and grabbed the violin.

43
00:02:52.499 --> 00:02:57.057
"Your performance has been canceled, Violet!"

44
00:02:57.058 --> 00:02:58.944
Audience members woke up.

45
00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:02.684
They looked around in surprise.

46
00:03:02.685 --> 00:03:05.642
"What's going on?" a man shouted.

47
00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:08.702
"Why am I on the stage?"

48
00:03:08.703 --> 00:03:11.017
"Look!" Terrell cried.

49
00:03:11.018 --> 00:03:17.887
"Rocket Girl is onstage! Is she playing the violin?"

50
00:03:17.888 --> 00:03:25.066
Roxy grabbed Violet's wrist and flew her to Police Headquarters.

51
00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:27.277
"Roxy!" said Mara.

52
00:03:27.278 --> 00:03:30.629
"You missed the beginning of the concert."

53
00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.630
Roxy sat down next to her friends.

54
00:03:33.631 --> 00:03:37.633
Up onstage, the orchestra played.

55
00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.948
Terrell leaned toward Roxy.

56
00:03:39.949 --> 00:03:43.580
"You were wrong about Rocket Girl," he whispered.

57
00:03:43.581 --> 00:03:46.213
"She plays the violin."

58
00:03:46.214 --> 00:03:49.409
"Shh," Roxy whispered with a smile.

59
00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:54.567
"Let's just enjoy the music."
